# The Convenio Marco reference catalog is a versioned reference dataset (ADR 0024):
# a single, weekly-refreshed file that is the normative evidence CM leads cite, so
# it is committed (reproducible via osint-cm-fetch if history bloat ever forces a swap).
!data/cm_catalog.parquet

# API response cache and rolling request log (local operational state)
data/cache/
data/api_usage.log
